  ('[SCENARIO] Your company wants to implement a new employee monitoring system using AI-powered cameras. Before deployment, what should you conduct?', '["Market research only","Data Protection Impact Assessment (DPIA) to evaluate privacy risks","Financial feasibility study only","No assessment needed if employees are informed"]'::jsonb, 1, 5, true, 'advanced'),
  ('Under Section 8(6), when must a Data Fiduciary notify Data Principals about a breach?', '["Always, within 72 hours","Only if harm is likely to be caused","Never, only the Board needs notification","Within 30 days in all cases"]'::jsonb, 0, 5, false, 'advanced'),
  ('What is the first phase in the 6-phase incident response lifecycle?', '["Containment","Detection & Identification","Assessment & Triage","Eradication & Recovery"]'::jsonb, 1, 5, false, 'advanced'),
