  ('Which encryption standard is recommended for data at rest?', '["DES","MD5","AES-256","SHA-1"]'::jsonb, 2, 5, false, 'advanced'),
  ('[SCENARIO] Your database containing 500,000 customer records is stored without encryption. A disgruntled employee copies it to a USB drive. What DPDPA violations occurred?', '["None, employee theft is not covered","Failure to implement reasonable security safeguards (Section 8(5)) - penalty up to ₹250 crore","Only breach notification failure","No violation if data is recovered"]'::jsonb, 1, 5, true, 'advanced'),
  ('According to Section 8(8), who is accountable for Data Processors?', '["The Data Processor themselves","The Data Protection Board","The Data Fiduciary","The Data Principal"]'::jsonb, 2, 5, false, 'advanced'),
  ('What are the 3 most essential clauses in a Data Processing Agreement (DPA)?', '["Payment terms, SLAs, Termination","Scope of Processing, Processor Obligations, Data Return/Deletion","Insurance, Indemnity, Warranties","Audit rights, Penalties, Force majeure"]'::jsonb, 1, 5, false, 'advanced'),
  ('In vendor risk tiering, which tier requires SOC 2 Type II compliance?', '["Low tier vendors","Medium tier vendors","High tier vendors","Critical tier vendors"]'::jsonb, 3, 5, false, 'advanced'),
  ('[SCENARIO] You''re selecting a cloud vendor to process sensitive customer data. The vendor has ISO 27001 but no SOC 2. What should you do?', '["Proceed, ISO 27001 is sufficient","Request SOC 2 Type II certification OR conduct detailed security assessment before onboarding","Reject immediately","No security requirements needed for cloud vendors"]'::jsonb, 1, 5, true, 'advanced'),
  ('What is the recommended frequency for reviewing access controls?', '["Monthly","Quarterly","Annually","Only when incidents occur"]'::jsonb, 1, 5, false, 'advanced'),
  ('What is ''Machine Unlearning'' in the context of Data Principal rights?', '["Deleting AI models completely","Removing specific data''s influence from trained models","Preventing AI from learning new data","Disabling machine learning features"]'::jsonb, 1, 5, false, 'advanced'),
  ('What does ''Technical Safeguard'' encompass in the context of Rule 6?', '["Only firewall and antivirus","Encryption, access control, network security, logging, data masking, backup","Physical security measures only","Employee training programs"]'::jsonb, 1, 5, false, 'advanced'),
  ('In the AI lifecycle under DPDPA, how many stages are typically identified?', '["4 stages","6 stages","8 stages","10 stages"]'::jsonb, 2, 6, false, 'advanced'),
  ('What is the core challenge of applying DPDPA''s data minimization principle to AI systems?', '["AI doesn''t use personal data","Tension between ''more data = better models'' and ''collect only necessary data''","AI systems are exempt from minimization","Minimization only applies to training, not inference"]'::jsonb, 1, 6, false, 'advanced'),
  ('Which privacy-preserving ML technique allows training models without centralizing raw data?', '["Differential Privacy","Federated Learning","Homomorphic Encryption","Synthetic Data Generation"]'::jsonb, 1, 6, false, 'advanced'),
  ('What does k-anonymity achieve in ML training data?', '["Encrypts all data fields","Ensures each group has at least k individuals, making re-identification difficult","Removes all identifiers completely","Adds random noise to data"]'::jsonb, 1, 6, false, 'advanced'),
  ('[SCENARIO] A hospital wants to train an AI model for disease prediction using patient records. Under DPDPA, what is the compliance pathway?', '["Can use data freely for medical research","Must obtain explicit consent OR use anonymized data OR rely on legitimate medical purpose exemption with safeguards","AI training is completely prohibited for medical data","No restrictions for hospitals"]'::jsonb, 1, 6, true, 'advanced'),
  ('When is consent required for AI processing under DPDPA?', '["Always, for any AI use","Never, AI is exempt","For non-essential AI like marketing/profiling, but not for fraud detection","Only for AI using biometric data"]'::jsonb, 2, 6, false, 'advanced'),
  ('What must be included in AI transparency notices to Data Principals?', '["Complete source code of the algorithm","Meaningful information about logic, significance, and consequences","Only that AI is used, no details needed","Mathematical formulas of the model"]'::jsonb, 1, 6, false, 'advanced'),
  ('Which type of AI bias results from training data reflecting past discrimination?', '["Measurement Bias","Historical Bias","Aggregation Bias","Evaluation Bias"]'::jsonb, 1, 6, false, 'advanced'),
